The getDemoWeatherData() function returns data in a different structure than what updateWeatherDisplay() expects.

When using demo data, loadWeatherData() calls getDemoWeatherData(), which returns an object with a current property. However, the demo data generation has a bug - it's not consistently returning the full structure.

